      <title>先知与先机：黄仁勋、马斯克的十年盟约与汽车业的未来之争</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251204-%E5%85%88%E7%9F%A5%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%88%E6%9C%BA%E9%BB%84%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%8B%E9%A9%AC%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E7%9B%9F%E7%BA%A6%E4%B8%8E%E6%B1%BD%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%89/</link>
